    body: "Validation error reference Stable The pack validator emits stable, namespaced diagnostic codes. The code is the contract — tooling switches on it, never on the message string. The table below is normative reference derived from the ValidationDiagnosticCode registry in @tenkacloud/problem-sdk . Every code has a user-facing explanation here, and the drift check fails the build if a code is added without one. Codes Code What it means / how to fix it PACK_ARTIFACT_MISSING A problem declares an artifact (template / entry) that does not exist. PACK_ARTIFACT_TRAVERSAL A problem references a deploy artifact outside its own directory. PACK_DIR_MISSING The pack directory does not exist. Check the path passed to the validator. PACK_DUPLICATE_PROBLEM_ID Two problems in the pack declare the same id; ids must be unique. PACK_MANIFEST_INVALID tenkacloud-pack.json failed schema validation. The accompanying path points at the offending field. PACK_MANIFEST_MISSING No tenkacloud-pack.json was found at the pack root. PACK_MANIFEST_UNREADABLE tenkacloud-pack.json exists but could not be read or parsed as JSON. PACK_PROBLEMS_ROOT_MISSING The directory named by problemsRoot does not exist inside the pack. PACK_PROBLEMS_ROOT_TRAVERSAL problemsRoot escapes the pack root (absolute path or '..' traversal). PROBLEM_METADATA_INVALID A problem's metadata.json is not a valid object or a required field is missing / malformed. RUNTIME_MISMATCH A declared runtime '(provider/engine)' is not a supported runtime capability (a typo or an unsupported pair). Codes are namespaced PACK_* / PROBLEM_* / RUNTIME_* . Adding a code is an additive (minor) change; removing or repurposing one is a major change. Reading a diagnostic Each diagnostic carries the stable code , a path locating the offending value ( tenkacloud-pack.json:id or metadata.json:scoring ), and a remediation message . Run tenkacloud pack validate <dir> --json to get machine-readable output. Related: CLI reference and the pack manifest reference . 検証エラーリファレンス Stable パックバリデーターは、安定した名前空間付きの診断コードを発行します。契約となるのは code です。ツールは code で分岐し、メッセージ文字列で分岐することは決してありません。 以下の表は、 @tenkacloud/problem-sdk の ValidationDiagnosticCode レジストリから 導出された 規範的リファレンス です。すべてのコードにはこのページにユーザー向けの 説明があり、説明のないコードが追加された場合はドリフトチェックがビルドを失敗させます。 コード Code What it means / how to fix it PACK_ARTIFACT_MISSING A problem declares an artifact (template / entry) that does not exist. PACK_ARTIFACT_TRAVERSAL A problem references a deploy artifact outside its own directory. PACK_DIR_MISSING The pack directory does not exist. Check the path passed to the validator. PACK_DUPLICATE_PROBLEM_ID Two problems in the pack declare the same id; ids must be unique. PACK_MANIFEST_INVALID tenkacloud-pack.json failed schema validation. The accompanying path points at the offending field. PACK_MANIFEST_MISSING No tenkacloud-pack.json was found at the pack root. PACK_MANIFEST_UNREADABLE tenkacloud-pack.json exists but could not be read or parsed as JSON. PACK_PROBLEMS_ROOT_MISSING The directory named by problemsRoot does not exist inside the pack. PACK_PROBLEMS_ROOT_TRAVERSAL problemsRoot escapes the pack root (absolute path or '..' traversal). PROBLEM_METADATA_INVALID A problem's metadata.json is not a valid object or a required field is missing / malformed. RUNTIME_MISMATCH A declared runtime '(provider/engine)' is not a supported runtime capability (a typo or an unsupported pair). コードは PACK_* / PROBLEM_* / RUNTIME_* の名前空間を持ちます。コードの追加は 加算的な（マイナー）変更であり、コードの削除や意味の変更はメジャー変更です。 診断の読み方 各診断には、安定した code 、問題のある値の位置を示す path （ tenkacloud-pack.json:id や metadata.json:scoring ）、および修復方法を示す message が含まれます。機械可読な出力を得るには tenkacloud pack validate <dir> --json を実行してください。 関連: CLI リファレンス および パックマニフェストリファレンス 。",
